# Richard Shaw, collector of the paperwork of the end of the world. Client of "Dead Freight".
# Flags: b_freight_accepted, dead_freight(public), b_manifest_public (starts R5: Solara leaves).

%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('dead_freight(public)') || HasFlag('dead_freight(buried)')
goto: Done

cond: HasFlag('b_freight_accepted')
goto: Return

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: (A neat man surrounded by folders.) Richard Shaw. I collect records. Receipts, logs, manifests. The things that outlive us.
#
o_text: Looking for anything in particular?
o_id: ask_job
o_goto: Job
#
o_text: Not interested in paper.
o_id: default_bye
o_goto: End

name: Job
npc: The spaceport cargo terminal keeps the flight manifests. Every departure, every ton, every passenger.
+ Two sentry bots guard it; the port console in the arrivals hall runs them. Bring me a printout. Five hundred sat.
#
o_text: Why that one?
o_id: why_manifest
o_goto: Why
#
o_text: Five hundred. Done.
o_id: accept_freight
o_goto: Accepted
#
o_text: Find someone else.
o_id: decline_freight
o_goto: End

name: Why
npc: Because a thousand people in this city paid a million sat each for a berth, and I would like to see one. On paper.
#
o_text: Five hundred. Done.
o_id: accept_freight_why
o_goto: Accepted
#
o_text: Find someone else.
o_id: decline_freight_why
o_goto: End

name: Return
npc: The manifest?
#
o_text: Here. Cargo only. Zero berths, all hulls.
o_id: give_manifest
o_cond: HasItem('spaceport_manifest')
o_goto: Delivered
#
o_text: Still working on it.
o_id: return_bye
o_goto: End

name: Delivered
npc: (He reads it twice, then feeds it into a copier that was already warm.) Zero. I knew. Knowing is nothing; this is proof.
+ By tonight every public terminal has it. Five hundred, and my thanks.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'spaceport_manifest')
effect: PlayerAddGold(500)
effect: SetFlag('dead_freight(public)')
effect: SetFlag('b_manifest_public')
effect: SetFlag('KnowsAbout(ticket_scam)')
effect: RunScript('b_solara_leaves')
#
o_text: Solara Carter won't thank you.
o_id: delivered_bye
o_goto: End

name: Done
npc: Paper remembers what people won't. Good day.
#
o_text: Good day.
o_id: done_bye
o_goto: End

name: Accepted
npc: Cargo terminal, east room. Mind the sentries.
effect: SetFlag('b_freight_accepted')
effect: EndConversation

name: End
npc: (He returns to his folders.)
effect: EndConversation
